{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102002","id":2810617759,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6I9jlm","number":102002,"title":"Allow calling an Object's method on a specific CallQueue","user":{"login":"kisg","id":406832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjgzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg","html_url":"https://github.com/kisg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-01-25T00:04:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T11:03:28Z","closed_at":"2025-01-30T10:15:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102002","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102002","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102002.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102002.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This PR adds a new ``call_deferred_on_queue()`` method to the Object type.\r\n\r\nThis is required because call_deferred() semantics has changed: it is now possible to instantiate a CallQueue on a thread, and in this case, call_deferred() will schedule the call on the CallQueue associated with the current thread, instead of the CallQueue on the main thread.\r\n\r\nIn particular the ResourceLoader's thread instantiates a CallQueue, so call_deferred() calls on that thread are scheduled on that thread local CallQueue instance.\r\n\r\nThis new behavior interferes with the usage of ``EditorToaster::popup_str()`` which needs to be deferred on the main thread, because it modifies the scene tree. This PR also modifies popup_str to always defer to the main queue so it can modify the scene tree.\r\n\r\nWithout this change the popup_str() calls on the ResourceLoader thread result in error, like it is currently used in the ResourceImporterTexture class.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by [Migeran](https://migeran.com/).\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"kisg","id":406832,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjgzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/406832?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg","html_url":"https://github.com/kisg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kisg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102002/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}